# Phase 10b — Backup health & controls

**Branch:** `phase-10b-backup-ui`

## Goal

In-app backup status, manual run, and schedule/retention controls. Shared runner for API and optional systemd timer.

## Exit criteria

- List recent backups with health (fresh &lt; 36h)
- Run backup now (Postgres + uploads)
- **Restore** a listed backup after ConfirmDialog; safety backup first; refuses if safety dump fails
- **Delete** a listed backup after ConfirmDialog (removes folder under BACKUP_DIR)
- Edit schedule (hour/minute) + retainDays; in-process scheduler while API runs
- INSTALL documents in-app restore/delete + systemd timer alternative
